    "title": "FBI searches Fulton County election hub in criminal probe of 2020 election - NewsBreak",
    "text": "By Ben Whedon ,\n11 hours ago FBI agents were reportedly witnessed scouring the Fulton County Election Hub and Operation Center in Georgia. \"The FBI is conducting court-authorized law enforcement activity. No other information is available at this time,\" the FBI told Just the News. A separate, high-level official confirmed to Just the News that FBI search was in connection to a criminal probe linked to the 2020 election. Read full article\nRead in NewsBreak",
